
load @term/mill/code/book/film
  find book-film
  find book-film-bind

mint film, like book-film
  case kind
    slot kind
  case bind, mint film-bind
    slot bind
  hook make
    make book-film
      bind kind, read kind
      bind bind, read bind

mint film-bind, like book-film-bind
  case name
    slot name
  case value
    slot value
  hook make
    make book-film-bind
      bind name, read name
      bind value, read value
